{"id":50354,"date":"2026-04-01T11:53:31","date_gmt":"2026-04-01T10:53:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50354"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:55:04","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:55:04","slug":"meia-maratona-de-berlim","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-berlim\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de Berlim 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona de Berlim 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona de Berlim 2027<\/strong> (46\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <em>Generali Berliner Halbmarathon<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>4 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>10h05<\/strong> (e \u00e0s 09h15 para patinadores e 09h55 para atletas em cadeira de rodas e handbikers) na ic\u00f3nica <strong>Stra\u00dfe des 17. Juni<\/strong>, em <strong>Berlim, Alemanha<\/strong>. Integrada no prestigiado circuito europeu <strong>SuperHalfs<\/strong> e distinguida com o selo <em>World Athletics Label Road Race<\/em>, esta prova organizada pela <strong>SCC EVENTS GmbH<\/strong> (<em>Sport-Club Charlottenburg e.V.<\/em>) re\u00fane cerca de 40.000 participantes num dos tra\u00e7ados de 21,0975 km mais planos e r\u00e1pidos do mundo.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O percurso de volta \u00fanica liga o cora\u00e7\u00e3o monumental da capital alem\u00e3 a partir da zona entre a <strong>Porta de Brandemburgo<\/strong> e a Coluna da Vit\u00f3ria (<em>Siegess\u00e4ule<\/em>), passando pelo Castelo de Charlottenburg, pela elegante avenida Kurf\u00fcrstendamm (Ku'damm), pela Potsdamer Platz, pelo Checkpoint Charlie e pela Catedral de Berlim e Alexanderplatz, antes do regresso triunfal sob as colunas da Porta de Brandemburgo at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta na Stra\u00dfe des 17. Juni. Os atletas disp\u00f5em de um <strong>tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 3h15<\/strong> ap\u00f3s transporem o tapete de partida, devendo ter pelo menos <strong>16 anos de idade<\/strong> (nascidos em 2011 ou antes) de acordo com as condi\u00e7\u00f5es gerais de participa\u00e7\u00e3o (<em>Teilnahmebedingungen<\/em>) da SCC EVENTS. Na v\u00e9spera, s\u00e1bado, 3 de abril, o antigo Aeroporto de Tempelhof acolhe a feira do corredor (<em>GENERALI BERLIN HALF MARATHON EXPO<\/em>), a <strong>Garmin Berlin Mile<\/strong> (1,6 km \u00e0s 15h00) e as corridas infantis Bambini Run. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">4 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Stra\u00dfe des 17. Juni \/ Porta de Brandemburgo, Berlim, Alemanha<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21,1 km e 1,6 km (Milha)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">SCC EVENTS GmbH (Sport-Club Charlottenburg e.V.)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.scc-events.com\/teilnahmebedingungen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Generali Berlin Half Marathon (Corrida)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:05<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Generali Berlin Half Marathon (Inline Skating \/ Cadeiras de Rodas)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 4 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Garmin Berlin Mile<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a Meia Maratona de Berlim 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 46\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Generali Berlin Half Marathon realiza-se no domingo, 4 de abril de 2027, na Stra\u00dfe des 17. Juni, em Berlim. Os patinadores (Inline Skaters) partem \u00e0s 09h15, os atletas em cadeira de rodas e handbikers \u00e0s 09h55, e a corrida de 21,0975 km parte por vagas a partir das 10h05.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e a idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o na Meia Maratona de Berlim?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De acordo com o regulamento e as condi\u00e7\u00f5es gerais (Teilnahmebedingungen) da SCC EVENTS GmbH, o tempo limite oficial para concluir os 21,0975 km \u00e9 de 3 horas e 15 minutos ap\u00f3s cruzar a linha de partida. A idade m\u00ednima obrigat\u00f3ria para a meia maratona \u00e9 de 16 anos (nascidos em 2011 ou antes).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A Meia Maratona de Berlim faz parte do circuito SuperHalfs?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a Meia Maratona de Berlim \u00e9 uma das 6 meias maratonas europeias que comp\u00f5em o circuito oficial SuperHalfs (juntamente com Lisboa, Praga, Copenhaga, Cardiff e Val\u00eancia), garantindo carimbo digital no SuperPassport a todos os finalistas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde decorre o levantamento do dorsal e a Expo do corredor?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento obrigat\u00f3rio e presencial do kit de atleta (mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do Start Card e documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial) realiza-se na GENERALI BERLIN HALF MARATHON EXPO, instalada nos hist\u00f3ricos hangares do antigo Aeroporto de Tempelhof (Platz der Luftbr\u00fccke 5, Berlim), na sexta-feira e no s\u00e1bado anteriores \u00e0 corrida.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para a Meia Maratona de Berlim 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Devido \u00e0 elevada procura, os dorsais individuais para a corrida s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos atrav\u00e9s de sorteio oficial (ballot) organizado pela SCC EVENTS, sendo tamb\u00e9m poss\u00edvel garantir inscri\u00e7\u00e3o direta atrav\u00e9s de institui\u00e7\u00f5es solid\u00e1rias parceiras ou operadores tur\u00edsticos desportivos oficiais.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de Berlim 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-04\", \"endDate\": \"2027-04-04\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Berlim, Alemanha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Alemanha\", \"addressRegion\": \"Alemanha\", \"addressCountry\": \"DE\"}}, \"description\": \"A Meia Maratona de Berlim 2027 realiza-se a 4 de abril na Alemanha. Corre os 21,1 km das SuperHalfs pela Porta de Brandemburgo e garante j\u00e1 a tua inscri\u00e7\u00e3o!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-de-berlim.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.generali-berliner-halbmarathon.de\/en\/\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\",