EXPO, instalada nos hist\u00f3ricos hangares do antigo Aeroporto de Tempelhof (Platz der Luftbr\u00fccke 5, Berlim), na sexta-feira e no s\u00e1bado anteriores \u00e0 corrida.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para a Meia Maratona de Berlim 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Devido \u00e0 elevada procura, os dorsais individuais para a corrida s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos atrav\u00e9s de sorteio oficial (ballot) organizado pela SCC EVENTS, sendo tamb\u00e9m poss\u00edvel garantir inscri\u00e7\u00e3o direta atrav\u00e9s de institui\u00e7\u00f5es solid\u00e1rias parceiras ou operadores tur\u00edsticos desportivos oficiais.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70407,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,41],"event_type_2":[1056,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[1096,882],"class_list":["post-50354","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-berlim-alemanha","event_type-corrida","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-alemanha","event_type_2-europa","event_type_5-majors","event_type_5-superhalfs"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-de-berlim.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50354","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=50354"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https